    a dcat:Catalog ;
    dcterms:conformsTo <http://wikiba.se/ontology> ;
    dcterms:description "A static, read-only Wikibase of the OpenStreetMap features within 120 m of Govan Old in Glasgow (church, churchyard, historic objects and the museum The Govan Stones). One item per OSM element, its version history as statements, anchored in CIDOC CRM." ;
